{"id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","title":"类成员结构的元语言满意关系","display":"df-class-satisfaction — 类成员结构的元语言满意关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class-satisfaction","aliases":["58-df-class-satisfaction"],"display":"df-class-satisfaction — 类成员结构的元语言满意关系","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class-satisfaction — 类成员结构的元语言满意关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为元语言类变量，元素均为集合；类量词不属于 ZFC 的集合量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>。变量、公式构造子及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 采用依赖文件定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 为有限变量赋值的集合图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto a]=(s\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times\\operatorname{ran}(s)))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}\">\\(s[x\\mapsto a]=(s\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times\\operatorname{ran}(s)))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是下式给出的元语言关系。满意关系按有限公式树递归；式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 为对应公式构造子，不对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 断言存在集合编码的真谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\">\\(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\)</span> 仅为最后一式给出的缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的自由变量包含于所列有限变量集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}assignment}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\ns\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq M\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}assignment}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\ns\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq M\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner x\\doteq y\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner x\\doteq y\\urcorner)\\land s(x)=s(y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner x\\dot\\in y\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner x\\dot\\in y\\urcorner)\\land s(x)\\in s(y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,s),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner)\\land\n(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,s)\\lor\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\psi,s)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land\n\\forall a\\in M\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner x\\doteq y\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner x\\doteq y\\urcorner)\\land s(x)=s(y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner x\\dot\\in y\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner x\\dot\\in y\\urcorner)\\land s(x)\\in s(y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,s),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner)\\land\n(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,s)\\lor\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\psi,s)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi\\urcorner,s)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,M,\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land\n\\forall a\\in M\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}notation}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\vec a\\in M^n\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}notation}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\vec a\\in M^n\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归的对象是元语言中的有限公式。真类参数只出现在类类型位置；本文件没有把真类结构代入集合编码的 Satisfaction_S。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false}